{"title": "Deathbringer's Sight", "pageid": 28382, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Deathbringer's_Sight", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Deathbringer's Sight</b> is a passive feature that increases the wearer's sight in darkness, as well as their chance to critically hit.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You can see in the dark up to 3 m (10 ft). The number you need to roll a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> while attacking is reduced by one. This effect can stack. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet\" title=\"Sarevok's Horned Helmet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet\" title=\"Sarevok's Horned Helmet\">Sarevok's Horned Helmet</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The in-game description claims that this can boost regular <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/20px-Darkvision_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/30px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/40px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/20px-Darkvision_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\">Darkvision</a> from 12 m (40 ft) to 15 m (50 ft). This is not the case.</li>\n<li>The stated Darkvision range of 3 m (10 ft) is incorrect. The <code>DarkvisionRange(3)</code> boost from this passive adds to the <code>MinimumDetectionRange</code> value of <code>2</code> found on all characters, effectively providing a Darkvision range of 5 m (17 ft).</li></ul>\n</div>  <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\">Darkvision</a> up to 3 m (10 ft). Attack roll needed for <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_hit\" title=\"Critical hit\">critical hits</a> reduced by 1.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200540\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1230/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11364/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4719/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 809377/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.502      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   43.502      1 -total\n 39.75%   17.292      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 34.97%   15.212      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 32.91%   14.316      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 17.02%    7.403      1 Template:Item_icon\n 14.48%    6.299      1 Template:SmPass\n 14.19%    6.171      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  8.63%    3.753      1 Template:PageSeo\n  8.40%    3.654      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28382-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200540 and revision id 385484. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}